  "_about": "Truth for infected_project/Ostorlab-Insecure-Flutter (Ostorlab/ostorlab_insecure_ios_app at the commit in infected_project/labs.json), written for evaluation/flutter_eval.py from the lab's README.md, which names one weakness per file of lib/bugs/, and from the code of those files. Each item cites the file (relative to the lab folder) and the line(s) of the weakness. 'cwe' lists the weaknesses that count as finding the item (canonical ids of sca.cwe): an open finding with one of them at most one line away from a location counts. 'hard' marks items that are not visible as a code pattern or setting (they need the intended behaviour, a flow across files or runtime behaviour); none of this lab's items is hard.",
